  "pitch_paragraph": "The track reaches full energy nine seconds in and holds there, so the interest lives in the topline rather than the arrangement — and the chorus doesn't land until 0:38, which is the first thing to look at for a single edit. The vocal is accommodating rather than demanding: it sits between A♯3 and B4 through the body and only reaches E5 at the top, so it suits a singer with presence in the middle of the range instead of one who needs the ceiling. All three choruses are near-identical, so any lift on the last one is a decision to be made in the room rather than something the demo already builds in. Bright and tightly centred, with the drop at 2:05 the only real dynamic event — that's the moment to produce around.",
